# Plugins

New estimator / estimand / backend / value_fn / normalizer / partition / absence_policy / renderer:

1. Implement the class
2. Register `[project.entry-points."nlp_shap.<group>"]` in `pyproject.toml`
3. Test via `PluginRegistry` resolution + real behavior
4. Follow skill `nlp-shap-plugin`

Do not add empty plugin packages or unregistered public kinds.
